iterations.reply:
The `with` clause grants only `http-client`, `notifier`, and `wall-clock`, so `state-rw` cannot be imported. I removed it and left out the `last-input` recording. Ask the platform team to add `aap:caps/state-rw@0.1.0` to the `with` clause if they want that behavior.

I also added a guard so the node traps instead of returning `notified: false`. The `ensures notified == true` contract applies to every output, so a refused notification should not produce an output.

